WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.000
Narrator: Marshals work on almost every leg.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.300
Narrator: On the Last Mile you welcome fans, give directions, work the crossings and watch the crowd build.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:18.100
Narrator: Before the security check point you check tickets by eye, run the queues and get fans ready - Security do the screening, never you.

4
00:00:26.500 --> 00:00:31.900
Narrator: At the gates you scan tickets and redirect fans who are at the wrong gate.

5
00:00:32.100 --> 00:00:38.200
Narrator: On the concourse and in the seating areas you give directions and keep routes and exits clear.

6
00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:43.000
Narrator: And at the end you're in your egress position, helping everyone home safely.

7
00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:48.600
Narrator: Watch the pressure points: the last thirty minutes before kick-off, half-time and the final whistle.

